# Documentation

A change is not done until docs exist. Follow `.cursor/skills/write-project-docs`.

## Every change (commit explanation)

Add an entry under `## Unreleased` in `docs/CHANGELOG.md`: what changed, why, which layers, tests, and the **proposed commit message**.

Also update `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` when status, stack, or domain summary becomes wrong.

## New work — create or update

| Kind | Location | Mirror |
|------|----------|--------|
| Feature / story | `docs/api/{service}/features/{name}.md` | `docs/api/account/features/login.md` |
| Controller / endpoint | `docs/api/{service}/controllers/` | `AuthController.md` |
| Service overview | `docs/api/{service}/README.md` | account README |
| Layer | `docs/architecture/{layer}.md` | dependency rules + example types |
| Domain model | `docs/domain/{name}.md` | invariants, factories, relations |
| Infrastructure | `docs/infra/{name}.md` | contract + implementation |
| Technology | `docs/tech/{name}.md` | why this library/hosting choice |

Link new pages from the parent README. Do not dump secrets into docs.
